# Pull request review

All pull requests for this repo go through Cursor Bugbot. The project guide is `.cursor/BUGBOT.md`.

- Open work on a branch and a pull request. Do not push launch changes straight to `main`.
- Bugbot reads `.cursor/BUGBOT.md` and `.cursor/config/bugbot.yaml` (`frequency: everyPush`).
- If no review appears, comment `cursor review` on the pull request.
- Leave Bugbot findings that cite the project guide unresolved until they are fixed.
